    "body": "## Summary\n\n- centralize the closed anonymous HTTP allowlist and `/admin/**` boundary used by `SecurityConfig`\n- make the Stripe webhook public for `POST` only instead of every HTTP method\n- discover every `@RestController` mapping in a regression test and require each private/admin endpoint to carry an authenticated `User`, with one documented actorless authenticated read\n- pin the anonymous HTTP surface to 17 existing controller endpoints so accidental exposure or stale matchers fail CI\n- document the anonymous, user, requester/worker and admin ownership matrix and update the verified 965-point roadmap\n\n## Verification\n\n- remote tree: `af606dd2e35e8244b162130964c730719ced2412` (identical to the reviewed local tree)\n- one commit, six files, 337 additions / 37 deletions\n- controller source audit: 134 mapped methods\n- roadmap structure: points 1–965 exactly once; 617 ✅ / 2 🟢 / 81 🟡 / 265 🔴\n- `git diff --check`\n\nThe exact remote head SHA will be held until all applicable GitHub Actions workflows finish successfully; reviews and unresolved threads will be checked again immediately before merge.",
